 ## How it works
-The RaySamples structure aggregates tensors representing the state of rays sampled through a scene. It is typically populated by a ray sampler (such as [Grid Ray Sampler](3930-grid-ray-sampler.md) or [Ray Sample Generation](12271-ray-sample-generation.md)) and consumed by an integrator.
